[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7024.95, "timestamp": "01:57:04", "text": "下午。所以从3到4到6，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7027.03, "timestamp": "01:57:07", "text": "晚上放上去。所以茶和点心会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7035.03, "timestamp": "01:57:15", "text": "是 4 到 6。呃，12 到 12 到呃，3 将是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7039.91, "timestamp": "01:57:19", "text": "呃，中午12点到下午3点是午餐时间。早餐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7042.35, "timestamp": "01:57:22", "text": "我把它放在早上6点左右。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7046.91, "timestamp": "01:57:26", "text": "是的。早上6点到凌晨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7049.229, "timestamp": "01:57:29", "text": "11:59 可以是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7050.211, "timestamp": "01:57:30", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"it depends on the time\" but who's gonna tell the pc your eating habits and sleeping times"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7051.43, "timestamp": "01:57:31", "text": "早餐。所以，我打算做一个新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7054.109, "timestamp": "01:57:34", "text": "这里有个东西。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7055.78, "timestamp": "01:57:35", "author": "@Mr_ManlyboiGD", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/G1AKH_mcI3-RWIHy2mO6H6B6JXNipyogvmXCFqsEaEoeQgso511w9m3HI3usVOCSFqPPETLpZg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "WAKE UP, IT'S THE FIRST OF THE MONTH"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7058.095, "timestamp": "01:57:38", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7058.31, "timestamp": "01:57:38", "text": "如果它检测到该餐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7067.189, "timestamp": "01:57:47", "text": "嗯，谁来告诉电脑你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7069.189, "timestamp": "01:57:49", "text": "呃，饮食习惯和睡眠时间？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7070.51, "t